==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
Esperanto ''[[ti-]]'' (demonstrative [[:Category:Esperanto correlatives|correlative]] prefix) + ''[[-u]]'' (correlative suffix of individuals)

===Pronoun===
'''tiu''' (''plural'' '''[[tiuj]]''', ''accusative singular'' '''[[tiun]]''', ''accusative plural'' '''[[tiujn]]''')
# [[who]], [[what]] [[person]], [[that]] [[one]]/[[person]]

===Determiner===
{{eo-det}}
# [[which]], [[that]]

===Usage notes===
''Tiu'' can be combined with ''[[ĉi]]'', the adverbial particle of proximity, or with ''[[for]]'', the adverbial particle of distance. ''[[ĉi tiu|Tiu ĉi]]'' thus means ''this [here] [one/person]'' and ''tiu for'' means ''that [distant] [one/person]''.

